# The cost to attack is determined as attackers are declared (CR 508.1h), from the effects then in force: a Ghostly Prison
# destroyed in the beginning of combat step asks nothing (CR 611.3a, its static ability is gone with it). Bot1 casts
# Disenchant on it with Mox Pearl and Mox Ruby, then attacks with both Llanowar Elves: no payment, Mox Sapphire and Mox
# Emerald stay untapped, and Bot2 takes 2.

